Author: shinyhunt

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 0
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatible with this plugin (0 / empty = all)
    # The 3GX loader already only loads plugins from sd:/luma/plugins/<TITLEID>/,
    # so this filter is secondary. For extra safety you MAY pin it to your
    # cartridge's low Title ID (read it from FBI -> Titles on the console).
    # Known low Title IDs for Alpha Sapphire:
    #   - 0x0011C500 (EUR)   0x0011C400 (USA)   0x0011C600 (JPN)
    # Leaving this empty targets all titles; the folder name still scopes loading.

Title: Autonomous Shiny Starter Hunter

Summary: Auto soft-resets ORAS for a shiny Mudkip, alerts via LED + jingle.

Description: |
  Unattended shiny-starter bot for Pokemon Omega Ruby / Alpha Sapphire.

  Soft-resets the game, advances to the starter bag, picks Mudkip, reads
  party slot 1 straight from memory, computes shininess and repeats until a
  shiny is generated. On a hit it sets a solid yellow notification LED and
  plays a shiny jingle, then holds that state so the console can be found by
  the LED alone with the lid closed.

  See docs/ for hardware calibration and the open-question test plan.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
